'''Vega''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Vega
|image = E 530.png
|first appearance = [[The Clawed Rondo (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has moderate health, moderate damage, long range with massive effective range and a 100% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] cats for 3 seconds, all with a high knockback count.

==Strategy==
This enemy has a nasty [[Long Distance]] attack, but a very small inner range, meaning that it is very vulnerable to rushers such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]].

